comment2.text=\r\n\ Computes\ the\ sum\ of\ two\ matrices\ a\ and\ b\ (which\ are\ assumed\ to\ be\ \r\n\ non-null\ and\ of\ equal\ dimension).\r\n\ \r\n\ @param\ a\ the\ first\ summand\r\n\ @param\ b\ the\ second\ summand\r\n\ @return\ a+b\ as\ a\ new\ matrix\ (2-d\ array).\r\n
