comment3.text=\r\n\ Computes\ the\ difference\ a-b\ of\ two\ matrices\ a\ and\ b\ \r\n\ (which\ are\ assumed\ to\ be\ non-null\ and\ of\ equal\ dimension).\r\n\ \r\n\ @param\ a\ a\ matrix\r\n\ @param\ b\ another\ matrix\r\n\ @return\ a-b\ as\ a\ new\ matrix\ (2-d\ array).\r\n
